#: ../../src/metrics.rst:5
msgid "Metrics operations"
msgstr "指标操作"

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:7
msgid ""
"libuv provides a metrics API to track various internal operations of the "
"event loop."
msgstr "libuv 提供指标 API，用于跟踪事件循环的各种内部操作。"

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:12
msgid "Data types"
msgstr "数据类型"

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:16
msgid ""
"The struct that contains event loop metrics. It is recommended to "
"retrieve these metrics in a :c:type:`uv_prepare_cb` in order to make sure"
" there are no inconsistencies with the metrics counters."
msgstr "包含事件循环指标的结构体。建议在 :c:type:`uv_prepare_cb` 中获取这些指标，以确保指标计数器不会出现不一致。"

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:32
msgid "Public members"
msgstr "公开成员"

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:36
msgid "Number of event loop iterations."
msgstr "事件循环迭代次数。"

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:40
msgid "Number of events that have been processed by the event handler."
msgstr "事件处理器已处理的事件数量。"

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:44
msgid ""
"Number of events that were waiting to be processed when the event "
"provider was called."
msgstr "事件提供程序被调用时正在等待处理的事件数量。"

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:49
msgid "API"
msgstr "API"

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:53
msgid ""
"Retrieve the amount of time the event loop has been idle in the kernel's "
"event provider (e.g. ``epoll_wait``). The call is thread safe."
msgstr "获取事件循环在内核的事件提供程序（例如 ``epoll_wait``）中处于空闲状态的时长。该调用是线程安全的。"

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:56
msgid ""
"The return value is the accumulated time spent idle in the kernel's event"
" provider starting from when the :c:type:`uv_loop_t` was configured to "
"collect the idle time."
msgstr "返回值是从 :c:type:`uv_loop_t` 被配置为收集空闲时间起，在内核的事件提供程序中累计的空闲时间。"

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:61
msgid ""
"The event loop will not begin accumulating the event provider's idle time"
" until calling :c:type:`uv_loop_configure` with "
":c:type:`UV_METRICS_IDLE_TIME`."
msgstr "在调用 :c:type:`uv_loop_configure` 并传入 :c:type:`UV_METRICS_IDLE_TIME` 之前，事件循环不会开始累计事件提供程序的空闲时间。"

#: ../../src/metrics.rst:69
msgid "Copy the current set of event loop metrics to the ``metrics`` pointer."
msgstr "将当前的事件循环指标集合复制到 ``metrics`` 指针。"

